---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 text-slate-300 text-sm leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-white">Affiliate & Editorial Disclosure</h1>
    <p>Last updated: January 2026</p>

    <p>
      StackCost Matrix (stackcost.apexcraftweb.com) is an independent publication and decision engine. 
      To keep our research tools free for founders and independent creators, some links on this website are affiliate links.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">How Affiliate Relationships Work</h2>
    <p>
      When you click certain links on our comparison tables and subsequently purchase a subscription or sign up for a paid plan, 
      we may receive a small referral commission at absolutely no additional cost to you. In many cases, our partnership links provide you with discounted rates, extended trial periods, or bonus credits.
    </p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mt-6">Editorial Independence</h2>
    <p>
      Our pricing audits, hidden fee warnings, and cost trap ratings are strictly objective. We do not accept sponsored placements that alter our rating criteria. If a tool has predatory egress charges, aggressive seat thresholds, or unexpected rate limits, we report it explicitly regardless of affiliate status.
    </p>
  </div>
</Layout>
